# ============================================================
# Large data / results
# ============================================================
# results/ is committed as per-scenario scores, aggregates, module metrics and
# raw transcripts. The transcripts are published because Sections 4.3 and 5.2
# argue from them; the synthetic secret markers that trip generic secret
# scanners have been replaced by repro/redact_transcripts.py. Console logs are
# still excluded.
results/runs/*/*/run.log
results/runs/trial_2/
results/runs/trial_3/
transcripts/
scripts/
Multi-User-LLM-Agent/data/
Multi-User-LLM-Agent/results/
Multi-User-LLM-Agent/IHEval/

